OL,3,A'Painful' years ahead, think tanks
OL,4,Awarn, as living standards set to fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople are facing a "painful" and
OL,7,F"depressing" few years ahead, economic
OL,8,Fthink tanks have warned, after
OL,9,Fforecasts showed growth in living
OL,10,Fstandards grinding almost to a halt.
OL,12,FTypical working-age households would
OL,13,Fsee their disposable income fall by
OL,14,F#1,050, or 3%, between now and 2029,
OL,15,Faccording to the Resolution Foundation,
OL,16,Fwhile the Institute for Fiscal Studies
OL,17,F(IFS) said the current decade would be
OL,18,Fthe worst for household income growth
OL,19,Fon record.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
